WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
Lie perfectly still all day.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.470
Your body still uses
energy: for every heartbeat,

3
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.890
every breath, and to keep
its temperature steady.

4
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:14.300
For most people, that resting cost is
the largest part of all the energy they

5
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.390
use.

6
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.000
Now eat a little more than you use.

7
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.750
An extra snack here, a spoonful there.

8
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.990
Every day.

9
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.940
So where does that extra energy end up?

10
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.230
In this mission, you'll
build a day's energy budget,

11
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.960
comparing the energy coming
in with the energy going out.

12
00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:37.010
Then you'll read data from a diet
with fixed food intake for 24 weeks,

13
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.670
and work out why weight loss slows.

14
00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.470
Your mission: find out where
the extra energy ends up.
